2026-05-10 20:08:01,687 - INFO - - **Persistence:** Consistent effort can overcome many obstacles and setbacks.
2026-05-10 20:08:01,688 - INFO - - **Opportunity Creation:** By working hard, you can create more opportunities for yourself, making it more likely that you will be in the right place at the right time.
